      en: ["The Shivee Ovoo mine officially began operations in the year 1990.", "It is located in Govisumber Province, about 260 km south of Ulaanbaatar.", "The mine's annual production capacity is approximately 2 million tons.", "Estimated total coal reserves at the deposit are about 2.7 billion tons.", "It supplies the majority of its coal to Ulaanbaatar's largest power plant.", "The facility is directly connected to the Trans-Mongolian Railway network."],
