      en: ["The plant was built between 1990 and 1994 with Japanese assistance.", "It is the largest metallurgical facility in Mongolia, based in Darkhan.", "The annual production capacity for crude steel is around 100,000 tons.", "It primarily produces steel bars (rebar) for the local construction industry.", "The plant has expanded into iron ore processing from its own mines.", "It is a major state-owned company employing hundreds of workers."],
